# Repository guidance

Use Node.js 24 or newer and the pnpm version in `package.json`. Read `README.md`, `docs/DEVELOPMENT.md`, and `docs/tool-reference.md` before changing runtime behavior.

Run `pnpm build`, `pnpm test` (macOS), `pnpm lint`, `pnpm typecheck`, and `pnpm validate`. The tests use the MCP SDK directly; browser/Inspector automation is optional for manual investigations.

Keep stdout reserved for the MCP protocol. Scripts run with the host user's privileges; use synthetic inputs and task-owned temporary files for live proof. Document macOS permissions and inputs when contributing knowledge-base scripts.
